	)
	(text "pH \n(+/- 600mV)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.748 61.214 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "89d775f1-b192-4a72-b0a5-91f8e836a1a5")
	)
	(text "Note that the Atlas Scientific DO board is simply a \n5-3.3V regulator coupled with a non-inverting amp with \n10x gain on it. 100% saturation is 42mV out of the \nA.S. board so I'm assuming the probe outputs a max of \n4.2mV. We will simply use a 960X gain stage here giving\nus very nearly full scale at 100% saturation.\n\nGAIN = 960x\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.058 70.612 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9015f0ed-bdbb-4ee2-aacf-375d974f6710")
	)
	(text "Ext Temperature Sense\nPT-1000 Probe (960-1156Ohm)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 103.886 78.232 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9e244791-0f45-49fd-9d01-4a455d93bdd1")
	)
	(text "Dissolved Oxygen (Analog)\n4.2mV = 100% saturation (probe)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.644 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "aa64a8de-812b-4e80-ae00-5f6e4a82ff61")
	)
	(text "This is initially for the Atlas Scientific Conductivity board.\nIt is required to initialize the EC_EZO module to I2C comms.\nSee the EZO-EC datasheet for more information."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 103.886 181.102 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "af47f3a6-b8ee-49fb-b622-0f893d5ee2ca")
	)
	(text "Assuming a B[25/50] of 4250 (from ERTJ thermistor manual)\n@0   R=3.582*10k    = 35820\n@25  R=1 * 10k      = 10k\n@100 R=0.5353 * 10k = 5353\nWith a top resistor of 10k and a bias of 4.096 we have an\noutput range of [3.451, 1.4281] delta = 2.023V range.\nThis is about 0.020mV / C for that range. That corresponds\nto about 20 LSB / C less nonlinearity. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105.156 62.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b3c6b0e7-708a-4a83-952e-e0734bc2e428")
	)
	(text "NOTE!!! The header socket is flipped for mounting the \ncarrier board upsidedown."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.934 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c8f1f862-a65b-411c-9bed-a7edd61f0ede")
	)
	(text "Ext Temperature Sense\nNTC 10k "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.902 18.542 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.254)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ef16e3f6-e9b0-468c-9e9a-7aec64d0ebcc")
	)
	(text "Gain = 27\n1k precision resistor gives\n@0C   R=1k\n@25C  R=1097.3\n@40C  R=1155.4\nWith a top resistor of 1k and a bias of 4.096 we have an\noutput range of [2.048, 2.196] delta = 0.148V range.\nThis is about  mV / C  which corresponds to about \n  LSB / C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 103.886 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f2df75b9-5e53-41e4-a6d6-cd9cc0dfe530")
	)
